Fork and modification notice

Syngle Observatory is a hard fork of RustGIS (https://github.com/opengeos/RustGIS), Copyright the
RustGIS contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The fork is owned by Syngle,
is changed freely and is never merged back; upstream is read-only.

Files in this repository have been modified for the fork: the product name ("Syngle Observatory"),
the application id (com.syngle.observatory), every user-visible string and the interface
translations, the web page and its manifest, the packaging metadata for every platform, and the
community, website, asset and service addresses of the upstream project (the fork has no website,
asset host, plugin registry or download mirror, so commands that need one now require an explicit
address). The upstream project's icon, logo and brand assets were not carried over. The two
licence-relevant files, LICENSE (Apache-2.0, unchanged) and ATTRIBUTION.md (every third-party
work, unmodified), are kept, and the upstream project is credited there and in the About box.

Changes specific to the fork, beyond the rename: `rustgis-web` gains a `canvas-only` feature (the
map view alone, no egui chrome; ADR 0010), and `crates/observatory-engine` is the native engine
sidecar moved out of `syngle-spike/engine` (#43) into a fork crate with tests. See the fork's
ticket and the Syngle-Ecosystem repository for the decisions.
